first-item or empty fallbacks, then replace them with typed required lookups, build-time assertions, or explicit empty states."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"debounced-route-input-sync-audit"},{"type":"text","value":": find inputs that initialize from URL search and debounce writes back, then verify external route changes, browser back/forward, pending edits, and unmount cancellation keep visible state and URL state aligned."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"external-package-metadata-url-audit"},{"type":"text","value":": find npm/package metadata URLs rendered into anchors, image tags, markdown, or deploy links, then normalize protocols, repository shorthands, labels, and host allowlists before display."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"registry-ingestion-transaction-audit"},{"type":"text","value":": find package/version ingestion paths that delete and reinsert derived rows, then wrap replacement plus status updates in transactions with retry-safe previous data behavior."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"static-profile-url-validation-audit"},{"type":"text","value":": find maintainer/team/customer/sponsor data rendered into external anchors or images, then validate protocols, bare domains, host labels, and broken-profile fallbacks at build time."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"legacy-redirect-segment-audit"},{"type":"text","value":": find route redirect tables that use string prefix or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"includes"},{"type":"text","value":" checks, then replace them with URL-parsed, segment-aware matchers and tests for near-prefix paths and query-string false positives."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","chi