eature cards nest external links inside buttons","level":3},{"id":"p2-product-drawer-cannot-add-some-valid-variants","text":"P2 - Product drawer cannot add some valid variants","level":3},{"id":"p3-cart-optimistic-updates-rely-on-a-module-counter-and-a-casted-line-shape","text":"P3 - Cart optimistic updates rely on a module counter and a casted line shape","level":3},{"id":"p3-product-add-to-cart-ui-claims-success-before-the-mutation-succeeds","text":"P3 - Product add-to-cart UI claims success before the mutation succeeds","level":3},{"id":"p3-product-quick-view-drawer-is-modal-like-but-not-modal","text":"P3 - Product quick-view drawer is modal-like but not modal","level":3},{"id":"p3-product-page-assumes-shopify-products-always-have-option-values-and-variants","text":"P3 - Product page assumes Shopify products always have option values and variants","level":3},{"id":"p2-public-pagination-schemas-often-have-minimums-but-no-maximums","text":"P2 - Public pagination schemas often have minimums but no maximums","level":3},{"id":"p2-p3-type-casts-hide-route-and-schema-drift","text":"P2/P3 - Type casts hide route and schema drift","level":3},{"id":"p3-stack-category-library-lookups-fail-open-to-the-wrong-product","text":"P3 - Stack category library lookups fail open to the wrong product","level":3},{"id":"p3-stack-category-related-posts-are-not-sorted-across-libraries","text":"P3 - Stack category related posts are not sorted across libraries","level":3},{"id":"p3-maintainer-role-helpers-fail-open-to-contributor","text":"P3 - Maintainer role helpers fail open to Contributor","level":3},{"id":"p3-public-library-catalog-uses-a-one-off-hidden-library-filter","text":"P3 - Public library catalog uses a one-off hidden-library filter","level":3},{"id":"p3-partner-detail-pages-hardcode-volatile-claims-as-code","text":"P3 - Partner detail pages hardcode volatile claims as code","level":3},{"id":"p3-partner-rotation-analytics-sends-high-cardinality-session-seeds","text":"P3 - Partne